### Health check
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/health

### Upload a document
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/documents/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

This is a sample document for testing the RAG platform.
It contains some text that can be chunked and indexed.
--boundary--

### List documents
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/documents

### Get document by ID (replace with actual UUID)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/documents/{{document_id}}

### Index a document (replace with actual UUID)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/documents/{{document_id}}/index

### Ask a question
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/qa/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the main topic of the document?",
  "top_k": 5
}

### Ask with specific documents
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/qa/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What are the key findings?",
  "document_ids": ["{{document_id}}"],
  "top_k": 3
}

### Stream an answer
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/qa/ask/stream
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Summarize the document",
  "top_k": 5
}

### Extract structured data
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/extract/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "document_id": "{{document_id}}",
  "schema_definition": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "title": {"type": "string"},
      "summary": {"type": "string"},
      "key_topics": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {"type": "string"}
      }
    },
    "required": ["title", "summary"]
  },
  "instructions": "Extract the title, a brief summary, and key topics from this document."
}

### Create an indexing job
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "job_type": "index_document",
  "payload": {
    "document_id": "{{document_id}}"
  }
}

### Get job status (replace with actual UUID)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/jobs/{{job_id}}
